;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\Ghost.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\料亭部屋.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\美冬バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"Mm... <STYLE ID="1">Auntie</STYLE>, there's still a lot I need to tell you. 
{PAUSE ""}
I'll tell you everything I've seen and everything I've done."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">I was gazing steadily at </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Auntie</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, a complete change from before, and </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Auntie</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> looked a little taken aback.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Then </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Auntie</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> stood up and sat down again right across from me.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">And she drank down her lukewarm tea.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"What you did, </STYLE>Chigaya-chan<STYLE ID="1">, might be just the tip of the iceberg when you look at the curse-killings as a whole. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
Chigaya-chan<STYLE ID="1">, if you did it all on your own, it's just too big a story, somehow..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Mm... I think so too. It feels like everything connects, somehow... 
{PAUSE ""}
And like there's someone pulling the strings behind it all..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Someone pulling the strings?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Mm... I can't really explain it..."<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE>Chigaya-chan<STYLE ID="1">, even if there were someone like that, you mustn't go chasing after them right off. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">First, start with what we know, one step at a time."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Mm... You're right..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Then... I know it's hard to talk about, but </STYLE>Chigaya-chan<STYLE ID="1">, could you tell me what you know, in detail?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">I took a deep breath and called up those hateful memories.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">The curse-killings I committed from Shiyo 791 through 795.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Mom's</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> death, and the old man's suicide: to make them look connected to those, I carried them all out in April.</STYLE><PG>
"Mm... It started with that time 10 years ago when <STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE> ran off somewhere crying, remember?
{PAUSE ""}
　I saw the person who cut off <STYLE ID="3">Mom's</STYLE> head that day."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"What!?"</STYLE><PG>
"Mm... The one who cut off her head was <STYLE ID="4">Dad</STYLE>. 
{PAUSE ""}
Because <STYLE ID="5">Grandma</STYLE> couldn't save <STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE> when she was about to fall off the cliff. 
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Dad</STYLE> cut off her head to cover up <STYLE ID="5">Grandma's</STYLE> crime, so it would look like an obvious murder. 
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Dad</STYLE> seems convinced that <STYLE ID="5">Grandma</STYLE> pushed her, but <STYLE ID="5">Grandma</STYLE> never said a word in her own defense."<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"W-wait a minute, </STYLE>Chigaya-chan<STYLE ID="1">!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Are you... really sure about that?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Yeah... I clearly remember what the two of them said, and I saw the moment <STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE> fell, and the moment her head was cut off..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Then, </STYLE>Chigaya-chan<STYLE ID="1">, how did you find </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">your grandmother</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Huh? What do you mean, how... 
{PAUSE ""}
That time, I was walking along carrying <STYLE ID="6">Kana</STYLE>, and..."<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"That mountain stream runs for kilometers, doesn't it?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Wouldn't it be pretty hard to walk that cliff-like riverbank carrying </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Mm... But the place was right by the graveyard clearing, so I don't think it's strange that I just happened to find them..."<PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="2">No, wait a minute.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Did I find them by chance...?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">I don't think that's quite it.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">How did I find them...?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">That time...</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\渓流.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "800" "5000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\エデン\墓地昼.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{STOPSND "SE" "0" "PASS"}
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
